Z||000049||Ken Wittlief||05-02-2001||03:13 PM||||he didnt say he wouldnt read the forum anymore, just that he wouldnt post again.<P>one of the problems with these internet web sites and forums is you dont have the human interaction you get when you are present with a person in the same room - facial expressions, tone of voice, body language.<P>its really easy for someone to say something one way and for someone else to take it another way, and get PO'd when the other guy was just having fun.<P>if its just a matter of pride he can always start a second username and continue to post with that one.||||reg||1
