Z||000056||deceler8||05-03-2001||03:58 PM||||Seems I'm a little late to this party.<P>All I know is I just drove 2,000 miles the past ten days, got 36 miles per gallon, used a whole half quart of oil, had no mechanical problems, and now have a new set of cheap refinished tech wheels to boot.<P>36 mpg makes the $2 gas a lot easier to handle. All this from an '86 2m4, automatic.<P>Some of us are past the drive as fast as you can stage...I just like having a car that everyone looks at and is cheap to drive.||||reg||1
